<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Dec'96 inflation up 0.23 pct,4.05yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Dec'96 inflation up 0.23 pct,4.05yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's consumer prices rose 0.23 percent in December against 0.11 percent in November, the Bureau of Statistics said on Friday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise was 4.05 percent.</p>
<p>BANGLADESH CONSUMER PRICES</p>
<p>				     December  November  December 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change    0.23	 0.11     -0.61</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	4.05	 3.17	3.56</p>
<p>    Index (base 1973-74=100) 846	  844	 813</p>
</text>
